<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-13T16:11:18.790Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:11:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila, former president of the Democratic Republic of Congo, has formed a new political-military front that incorporates the M23 rebels in eastern DRC. His coalition is now fighting alongside M23 against the Congolese army, intensifying combat in the North Kivu region. Security personnel linked to Erik Prince were ambushed, resulting in the death of a former New Zealand special forces officer and wounds to former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,158 battle-related deaths recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE9aR191Sk1JajR0dHpEZklTWHZXTW5sbXdrTWhrc1A0VmFDd3ozakJ6NGdiampJSjgtVWhBT1gzaTlqU3JjeklEd01sb0xHSGFuRWU4ZGF3TUJRR0k?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9XSUJOd05Ub2pvYWF4Z0VBd2R3bW9ocGJpVWNQM2VHYUZVQWoyRHB4MTlhWWRSa252RmZlYm1GUTJMLXBxUTNzbFYyNkFOQl9uUzZLak85T25xb2d3WWfSAWNBVV95cUxNUVU0VHJ5b0xoNVdEYkNBM3A1TjRUR1ZkeERXb3JZRWFPZmVwSXFneVNmd0QwbV91ZTYwdWxjZFAxQVdodnNfcDAwT2NrbmlQV0NtMUtPamc1dE44Z2d4N29ZN2M?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPUlF4RUdiWkVKcG9qd2tDUUMwazFoZEVIZ3JyY1pEY0RROGFPRHp2dzItU3dHbDJUNFA4QU8wdW1nXzNfNjdSZDdHam9ZS1ZBWjFuS2lZMFJ4alI3SGt6R1dWT2NDcERVVXJpWjBjdzd6Z0tmUXViaTRFYUJydlQ0OU4ybmo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxPLTByaHp2aXdsckJqcUp3Z1ViazJ5YU5wN1BXS1hTNVpVNTZlRHdibDJNb092TEVhODdYWXdSaVMzemFrbHFGc1NqLUNSc1RxczBSMThiMl9vSFA3WVVHOU8yMlhoMVZPNjluTUUwd25hTFNvaUtLMmVkSUZoQ3VSbVlTZ0pTNHBNXzVIclQybUhqMGttNXBxSTgwdV81UlhlNGNqOWQxUlQ5czl6?oc=5&quo